。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["荀卿"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p009","quote":"當是時，魏有信陵君，楚有春申君，趙有平原君，齊有孟嘗君，皆下士喜賓客以相傾。呂不韋以秦之彊，羞不如，亦招致士，厚遇之，至食客三千人。是時諸侯多辯士，如荀卿之徒，著書布天下。呂不韋乃使其客人人著所聞，集論以為八覽、六論、十二紀，二十餘萬言。以為備天地萬物古今之事，號曰呂氏春秋。布咸陽市門，懸千金其上，延諸侯游士賓客有能增損一字者予千金。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p009","text":"當是時，魏有信陵君，楚有春申君，趙有平原君，齊有孟嘗君，皆下士喜賓客以相傾。呂不韋以秦之彊，羞不如，亦招致士，厚遇之，至食客三千人。是時諸侯多辯士，如荀卿之徒，著書布天下。呂不韋乃使其客人人著所聞，集論以為八覽、六論、十二紀，二十餘萬言。以為備天地萬物古今之事，號曰呂氏春秋。布咸陽市門，懸千金其上，延諸侯游士賓客有能增損一字者予千金。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"信陵君","kind":"person","person_id":"pc6_a84_ela","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"ucl_2oi_jyy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"ocj_6o3_ax8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"4ys_gkz_j29","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"賓客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"3f9_kxm_8rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"食客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未分成員，保留原稱不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"辯士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"